        judged by NO SECOND CRITERION: the Strsm T8/T1 ratio is retired as of 2026-10-05 (#177) and Strsm is in the class above. The work split and its falsified Amdahl ceiling are still printed per host, as evidence and never as a bar (#37/#89)
